2026-07-27T14:40:37.0891835Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T14:40:37.0892380Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T14:40:37.0893187Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T14:40:37.0894734Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T14:40:37.0896109Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
